OL,3,ACanada to match Trump tariffs 'dollar
OL,4,Afor dollar' on $20bn worth of US goods
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanada is responding to the threat of
OL,7,FUS tariffs as a trade war between the
OL,8,Ftwo countries escalates with $20bn of
OL,9,Fretaliatory tariffs on these US goods
OL,11,FOfficials are unveiling measures to
OL,12,F"protect and support Canadian workers
OL,13,Fand businesses" - you can watch live at
OL,14,Fthe link above
OL,16,FUS President Donald Trump yesterday
OL,17,Fthreatened to hike tariffs on Canadian
OL,18,Fvehicles to 50% from 1 January
